Z||000003||william_thorniii||01-12-2001||02:14 PM||||zeus,<P>Does this problem only occur just after morning startup or after it has been sitting a very long time (i.e. overnight)?  My Duke has always done this.  I spent over $1000 on new ECM's, sensors, plugs, wires, etc... before I figured out that it was just easier to baby the car up to operating temperature and then she was fine.  I have heard similar testimonials from other DIS Duke owners. <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||1
